{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33055","headline":"送进士李殷下第游汾河 · 曹邺","name":"送进士李殷下第游汾河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"上国花照地，遣君向西征。\n旁人亦有恨，况复故人情。\n单车欲云去，别酒忽然醒。\n如何今夜梦，半作道路程。\n边士不好礼，全家住军城。\n城中鼓角严，旅客常夜惊。\n中有左记室，逢人眼光明。\n西门未归者，下马如到京。\n还应一开卷，爲子心不平。\n殷懃说忠抱，壮志勿自轻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33055.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33055","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}